    "显示运营商、设备型号、设备标识号、硬件版本号、软件版本号等信息。": "Displays operator, device model, device serial number, hardware version, software version, etc.",
    "显示所建立的连接信息，其中包括：IP地址、连接状态、DNS、WAN MAC等信息。": "Displays connection information including: IP address, connection status, DNS, WAN MAC, etc.",
    "显示GPON状态、PON口的发射光功率、PON口的接收光功率、光模块的供电电压、光发送机的偏置电流、工作温度等信息。": "Displays GPON status, PON port transmit optical power, PON port receive optical power, optical module supply voltage, optical transmitter bias current, operating temperature, etc.",
    "显示以太网接口信息，其中包括：端口名称、状态、收包数/字节数及发包数/字节数等信息。": "Displays Ethernet interface information including: port name, status, received packets/bytes and transmitted packets/bytes, etc.",
    "显示USB端口连接设备的信息。": "Displays USB port connected device information.",
    "显示VoIP各用户线服务状态。": "Displays VoIP user line service status.",
    "查看交互建立状态。": "View session establishment status.",
    "查看业务配置下发状态。": "View service configuration delivery status.",
    "宽带连接相关参数设置，设置完成后，界面上显示普通设置信息：端口绑定设置；协议模式包括IPv4、IPv6、IPv4/IPv6；在IPv4协议下模式包括路由和桥接，其中路由模式设置包括PPPoE（若ISP使用PPPoE请选择该项，选择该操作将动态获取IP地址）、DHCP（从ISP处自动得到一个IP地址） 和Static（由ISP配置一个静态的IP地址。需要输入的信息包括：IP地址、子网掩码，首选DNS服务器及备用DNS服务器等，IP地址必须输入正确的格式，4个IP字节之间由“.”号分开（x.x.x.x）。例如：192.168.0.100），桥接模式设置Bridge（可以将设备配置成介于LAN和ISP之间的网桥设备；它可以使得两个或多个网络的通信就像处在同一LAN物理连接上）；在IPv6、IPv4/IPv6协议下模式包括PPP（若ISP使用PPPoE请选择该项，选择该操作将动态获取IP地址）和IP（从ISP处自动得到一个IP地址）；基本NAT功能打开和关闭；VLAN ID和802.1p优先级设置。": "Broadband connection parameter settings. After configuration, interface displays basic settings: port binding settings; protocol modes include IPv4, IPv6, IPv4/IPv6; IPv4 mode includes route and bridge, where route mode includes PPPoE (select if ISP uses PPPoE, will dynamically obtain IP address), DHCP (automatically gets IP from ISP), and Static (ISP configures static IP. Requires input: IP address, subnet mask, primary/secondary DNS. IP must be correct format: x.x.x.x); bridge mode includes Bridge (configures device as bridge between LAN and ISP); IPv6/IPv4+IPv6 modes include PPP (select if ISP uses PPPoE) and IP (automatically gets IP from ISP); basic NAT enable/disable; VLAN ID and 802.1p priority settings.",
    "配置宽带连接的公共组播VLAN值。": "Configure broadband connection multicast VLAN value.",
    "包含是否启用DHCP服务，分配给设备的租期、地址范围等参数的配置。": "Includes DHCP service enable, lease time, address range, etc.",
    "RA（路由器通告）可以向LAN侧的接入设备提供前缀地址和DNS地址，使接入设备可以更快地接入网络。使能：是否启用RA配置。最小等待时间：该值范围应该在3到1350之间。最大等待时间：该值范围应该在4到1800之间。最小等待时间小于最大等待时间。正常情况下，LAN侧接入设备会在最大等待时间和最小等待时间之间接收到路由器通告发送的前缀地址和DNS地址。除了LAN侧设备主动请求和RAServer主动续租。选择M字段：接入设备可以通过DHCPv6的方式得到IPv6前缀。选择O字段：接入设备可以通过DHCPv6的方式得到DNS地址等信息。": "RA (Router Advertisement) provides prefix and DNS addresses to LAN devices for faster access. Enable: RA enable. Min Wait Time: 3-1350. Max Wait Time: 4-1800. Min < Max. Normally LAN devices receive RA between min-max intervals. M flag: devices get IPv6 prefix via DHCPv6. O flag: devices get DNS info via DHCPv6.",
    "DHCP配置(IPV6)": "DHCP Configuration (IPv6)",
    "1.可配置网关的IPv6地址。2.IPv6动态地址管理，IP地址：配置网关的IPv6地址范围。启动DHCP服务：开启/关闭DHCPv6服务功能。DNS刷新时间：配置下发给client的DNS。": "1. Configure gateway IPv6 address. 2. IPv6 dynamic address management: configure address range. Enable DHCP: enable/disable DHCPv6. DNS refresh time: configure DNS provided to clients.",
    "IPv6前缀配置": "IPv6 Prefix Configuration",
    "配置IPv6前缀类型、WAN链接全路径": "Configure IPv6 prefix type, WAN connection full path.",
